Z||000005||KissMySSFiero||02-26-2001||11:05 PM||||sayin that it's a tad colder here is being very sarcastic.  <BR>nope no more spoilerless formula in fla.  i had that damn thing back on when i got home. hehe<BR>i figured that there would be a large amount of fiero clubs in the part of the country.  <BR>i meant within 20min or so.  <BR>is there anyone in the porter/chesterton/valpo/gary or merrillville area.  i guess thats a broad range, hehe but i want to see some more fieros.<BR>and i do plan on doin some kinda coatin underneath but the winter is over and i didnt have the money right now to do it. <BR>i am goin to be goin to archies v8 meet on april 21st by the way.  cant wait for that.  i plan on goin to something sooner if there is somehting.  i missed the daytona show by coming here already. i guess ill have to wait til next year.  <P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:KissMySSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:KissMySSFiero@netzero.net">KissMySSFiero@netzero.net</A>    <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">        <BR>"There's a fine line between love and beer"||||reg||1
